# Docker Hub Push Approval

- Never push images to Docker Hub without stopping and asking the user first.
- This applies to all Docker Hub operations that publish or overwrite remote image tags, including `docker push`, `docker buildx build --push`, and pushing `glilly/rpms:*`.
- Before pushing, state the exact image name, tag, source container or build input, and what verification has passed. Wait for explicit user approval before running the push.
